Comments: [Evaluator: Christian Iliadis; Date: 06/21/2024]
1.  Direct capture: C2S values of bound states from Endt 1990.
2.	Observed resonances: unless mentioned otherwise, from Endt 1990, where strengths have been normalized relative to Elab=2042 keV (see our table).
3.  Er = 766, 810, 1105, 1315 keV: weighted average of Cheng et al. and Kikstra et al.
4.  Er = 609, 668 keV: weighted average of Kikstra et al. and Scholz et al.
5.  Er = 33, 99, 158, 225, 438 keV: proton widths calculated from experimental C2S values reported by Fox et al. 2024.
6.  Er = 339, 422 keV: Gp from average of directly measured value (Scholz et al.) and transfer work (Fox et al).
7.  Gamma-ray partial widths for Er = 33, 422 keV from mean lifetimes listed in Endt 1990.
